@startuml d-class-core
title 食序 FoodFlow｜既有服務與共用類別圖（D 文件參考）
top to bottom direction
hide circle
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft JhengHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBorderColor #64748B
skinparam classBackgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 60

package "庫存操作契約" #FFF7ED {
  class StockOp <<frozen dataclass>> {
    +operation_group_id : UUID
    +operator_id : int
    +occurred_at : datetime
    +reason : str | None
  }
  abstract class StockLedger <<ABC>> {
    {abstract} +lock_batches(batch_ids) : list[InventoryBatch]
    {abstract} +lock_ingredient_batches(ingredient_id) : list[InventoryBatch]
    {abstract} +find_operation(group_id, tx_type) : list[InventoryTransaction]
    {abstract} +receive(item, op) : InventoryTransaction
    {abstract} +deduct(batch, quantity, tx_type, op, is_non_fefo) : InventoryTransaction
    {abstract} +adjust(batch, actual_quantity, op) : InventoryTransaction | None
    {abstract} +reverse(original, op) : InventoryTransaction
    {abstract} +move(batch, to_location_id, op) : BatchLocationChange | None
  }
  class SqlAlchemyStockLedger {
    -_session : Session
    -_locked_ids : set[int]
    -_locked_in : SessionTransaction | None
  }
}
package "交易邊界" #ECFDF5 {
  abstract class UnitOfWork <<ABC>> {
    {abstract} +transaction() : AbstractContextManager[None]
  }
  class SqlAlchemyUnitOfWork {
    -_session : Session
    -_active : bool
    --
    +transaction() : Iterator[None] <<contextmanager>>
  }
}
package "可替換時間來源" #EFF6FF {
  abstract class Clock <<ABC>> {
    {abstract} +now() : datetime
    +today() : date
  }
  class SystemClock {
    +now() : datetime
  }
  class FixedClock {
    -_fixed_now : datetime
    --
    +now() : datetime
  }
}
package "已實作範例：帳號 Service／Repository" #F5F3FF {
  class AuthService {
    -_repository : AuthRepository
    -_uow : UnitOfWork
    -_clock : Clock
    -_settings : Settings
    --
    +login(username, password) : tuple[Employee, str, datetime]
    +list_employees(search, role, is_active, page, page_size) : tuple[list[Employee], int]
    +create(operator_id, *, username, name, password, role, is_active) : Employee
    +bootstrap_admin(*, username, name, password) : Employee
    +update(operator_id, employee_id, *, name, role, is_active) : Employee
    +reset_password(operator_id, employee_id, password) : None
    +logout(employee_id) : None
  }
  abstract class AuthRepository <<ABC>> {
    {abstract} +find_username(username) : Employee | None
    {abstract} +lock_all() : list[Employee]
    {abstract} +list_employees(search, role, is_active, page, page_size) : tuple[list[Employee], int]
    {abstract} +add(employee) : None
    {abstract} +flush() : None
  }
  class SqlAlchemyAuthRepository {
    -_session : Session
  }
  class Settings <<reference>> {
  }
}
StockLedger <|-- SqlAlchemyStockLedger
UnitOfWork <|-- SqlAlchemyUnitOfWork
Clock <|-- SystemClock
Clock <|-- FixedClock
AuthRepository <|-- SqlAlchemyAuthRepository
StockLedger ..> StockOp : 方法參數
AuthService --> AuthRepository : _repository
AuthService --> UnitOfWork : _uow
AuthService --> Clock : _clock
AuthService --> Settings : _settings
note right of SqlAlchemyStockLedger
  覆寫 StockLedger 全部 8 個抽象方法。
  實體型別參照 B 類別圖。
  只 flush；交易由 Service 的 UoW 管理。
  時間由 StockOp 傳入。
end note
note bottom of SqlAlchemyAuthRepository
  覆寫 AuthRepository 全部 5 個抽象方法；只 flush。
end note
legend bottom left
  全部類別與方法皆取自目前原始碼
  + 公開；- 內部欄位（Python 慣例，非存取強制）
  空心三角為繼承；實線箭頭為持有相依；虛線箭頭為使用
  省略建構子、參數型別／預設值與具體實作重複的覆寫方法
  Iterator 是 @contextmanager 包裝前的原始碼型別
  尚未實作的進貨／查詢服務與設計模式另列於文件
endlegend
@enduml
